# release: the closed list of states of the machine "Release".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
open	initial	waiting	a release pull request is open and no check has started
checking	-	active	its hosted checks run
red	-	waiting	a required check failed
ready	-	waiting	every check is green, and the merge waits for yolo or a word
merged	final	final	the release is on main
abandoned	final	final	the release was closed unmerged
